},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1051","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[78,83,51,48,55,41],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13006","armor":"WP1009505","helmet":"WP1021305","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1051","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[78,83,51,48,55,41],"title":-1,"rank":"8","loyalty":"100","reputation":"6450","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13006","armor":"WP1009505","helmet":"WP1021305","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10064","city":"CS1051","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[78,83,51,48,55,41],"title":-1,"rank":"8","loyalty":"100","reputation":"6450","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13006","armor":"WP1009505","helmet":"WP1021305","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"袁术麾下第一骁将也。身长八尺余，擅操六十五斤重的两刃三尖刀。刘备攻击袁术时，出阵迎战关羽，与关羽大战良久未出胜负。后刘备驻扎小沛时，提兵进攻刘备，但吕布“辕门射戟”的示意后暂且退兵。后活跃于讨伐吕布的战况中，但因部下背叛而败退。袁术北上投靠袁绍的途中，被张飞十余回合所斩。","tc":"袁術麾下第一驍將也。身長八尺余，擅操六十五斤重的兩刃三尖刀。劉備攻擊袁術時，出陣迎戰關羽，與關羽大戰良久未出勝負。后劉備駐扎小沛時，提兵進攻劉備，但呂布“轅門射戟”的示意后暫且退兵。后活躍于討伐呂布的戰況中，但因部下背叛而敗退。袁術北上投靠袁紹的途中，被張飛十余回合所斬。","en":"The foremost warrior under Yuan Shu. He stood over eight chi tall and wielded a sixty-five-jin three-pointed, double-edged saber. When Liu Bei attacked Yuan Shu, Ji Ling took the field against Guan Yu, and the two fought at length without either gaining the upper hand. When Liu Bei was stationed at Xiaopei, Ji Ling marched to attack him, but Lu Bu's demonstration of ‘shooting the halberd at the gate’ compelled him to temporarily withdraw. He was later active in the campaign against Lu Bu but was defeated by his own subordinates' treachery. While Yuan Shu was fleeing north to join Yuan Shao, Ji Ling was cut down by Zhang Fei in just over ten bouts.","jp":"袁術配下随一の猛将。身長八尺余りで、重さ六十五斤の三尖両刃刀を巧みに操る。劉備が袁術を攻撃した際に出陣して関羽を迎え撃ち、激戦を繰り広げて勝敗がつかなかった。後に劉備が小沛に駐屯した際、兵を率いて劉備を攻めたが、呂布による「轅門射戟」の仲裁を受けてひとまず兵を退いた。その後、呂布討伐戦でも活躍したが、部下の裏切りに遭って敗退した。袁術が北上して袁紹を頼る途上、張飛に十ターン余りで斬られた。","kr":"원술 휘하 제일의 맹장이다. 신장이 8척 남짓이었으며, 65근 무게의 삼첨양인도를 능숙하게 다루었다. 유비가 원술을 공격했을 때 출진하여 관우를 맞아 싸웠고, 오랜 접전을 벌였으나 승부를 가리지 못했다. 이후 유비가 소패에 주둔하자 군사를 이끌고 유비를 공격했으나, 여포가 '원문사극'으로 중재의 뜻을 내비치자 잠시 군사를 물렸다. 그 후 여포 토벌전에서 활약했으나 부하의 배신으로 패퇴했다. 원술이 원소에게 의탁하고자 북상하던 도중, 장비와 맞붙어 10여 합 만에 베였다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10159","remark":"","surname":"纪","surnameTc":"紀","surnameEn":"Ji","surnameJp":"紀","surnameKr":"기","surnameOther":"","name":"灵","nameTc":"靈","nameEn":"Ling","nameJp":"霊","nameKr":"영","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"纪灵","power":"WJ10064","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1051","gender":"0","rule":"78","force":"83","wise":"51","politics":"48","charm":"55","will":"41","ruleTalent":"10","forceTalent":"11","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"4","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"33/85/33/33/33/16/50/33","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1005802;1010802","battleSkill":"1002200;1004200","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1000905","battleSoul":"1009105","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"6000","battleSoulPoint":"6800","debateSoulPoint":"2600","strategy":"1006715","strategy2":"1003901","professions":"3/3/3/0/0/0/3/0/0/0/3/3/2/1/2/0/1/0/0/1/0/2/0/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"5","compatible":"93","loyalty":"100","reputation":"6450","evaluate":"-2000","title":"","rank":"8","birth":"155","show":"184","death":